Package: BgeeDB
Type: Package
Title: Annotation and gene expression data retrieval from Bgee database. TopAnat, an anatomical entities Enrichment Analysis tool for UBERON ontology
Version: 2.39.6
Date: 2026-10-13
Authors@R: c(
    person("Julien", "Wollbrett", email = "julien.wollbrett@unil.ch", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Julien", "Roux", email = "julien.roux@unibas.ch", role = "aut"),
    person("Andrea", "Komljenovic", email = "andreakomljenovic@gmail.com", role = "aut"),
    person("Frederic", "Bastian", email = "bgee@sib.swiss", role = "aut"))
Description: BgeeDB gives access to the Bgee database (<https://www.bgee.org>), a curated
    resource of gene expression integrating bulk and single-cell RNA-seq, Affymetrix
    microarray, EST and in situ hybridization data. The package downloads the annotation of
    experiments and samples, the processed expression values at the sample or single-cell level
    and the integrated expression calls, and formats expression data as Bioconductor ExpressionSet
    objects. It also implements TopAnat, a GO-like enrichment analysis of anatomical terms from the
    UBERON ontology, mapped to genes by their expression patterns.
